<p>Likha hai jab Shaheed hue sibte Mustafa(saws)<br />
Us waqt hashr ran me namudaar hogaya<br />
Kaa'npi zamee'n badal gaya rang aasmaan ka<br />
Jibreel khaak udha ke pukaare basad buka</p>

<p>Paani diya na shimre layee'n ne Hussain(a.s) ko<br />
Pyaasa kiya shaheed shahe mashraqain ko</p>

<p>Dekho ujad gaya hai bhara ghar batool ka<br />
Gurbat me lut chuka hai bhara bhar batool ka</p>

<p>1. Daswi ki subha aisi Qayaamat dikha gayi<br />
Zehra(s.a) ke ghar pa mout ki badli si chaagayi<br />
Karbal me lut chuka hai bhara ghar batool ka</p>

<p>2. Teer o tabar ko dekhiye khanjar ko dekhiye<br />
Bacho'n ko dekhiye wo sitamgar ko dekhiye<br />
kya is liye saja hai bhara ghar batool ka</p>

<p>3. Barchi ani ki aankh ki binaayi legayi<br />
marne se bawafa ke tawanaayi bhi gayi<br />
Betaab o natawaa'n hai bhara ghar batool ka</p>

<p>4. Kha kar gale pa teer ko Asghar(a.s) bhi chal diye<br />
Qasim(a.s) bhi aur Aon(a.s) o Mohammad(a.s) bhi chal diye<br />
veeraan hogaya hai bhara ghar batool ka</p>

<p>5. Sarwar(a.s) ne bhook o pyaas me ghar ko luta diya<br />
Deene khuda ke waaste sar ko kata diya<br />
pyaasa hai be khata hai bhara ghar batool ka</p>

<p>6. Kar ke shaheed bhi unhe aaraam na diya<br />
har tan se har shaheed ke sar ko juda kiya<br />
Naizo'n pa saj gaya hai bhara ghar batool ka</p>

<p>7. Zehra(s.a) ke laadle ko kafan tak nahi mila<br />
Bete ne apne baap ko kaise wida kiya<br />
Be saaya be rida hai bhara ghar batool ka</p>

<p>8. Taboot shah ka tum jo uthaate ho aye <b>Zameer</b><br />
Samaa'n aza ke tum jo sajaate ho aye <b>Zameer</b><br />
rone ko aagaya hai bhara ghar batool ka</p>


